On this week's episode of <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/everything-we-know-about-iphone-18-pro/id1602394741?i=1000759057562">The MacRumors Show</a>, we talk through everything the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-18-pro/">iPhone 18 Pro</a> will feature, according to the latest rumors. <br/>
<br/>
